    "title": "Mansfield City Schools Takes First Step Toward New Elementary School - NewsBreak",
    "text": "9 hours ago Mansfield City Schools has taken the first formal step toward what could become the district’s first new elementary school in years. The Board of Education recently approved a resolution to conditionally participate in the Ohio Facilities Construction Commission’s Expedited Local Partnership Program, allowing the district to begin planning for a potential new elementary school project. Read full article",
